616 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Managing time off should be simple\054 but many leave\055management platforms still feel centered on administration rather than on the employee experience\056 TIMEOFF\056GURU is strong in core functionality such as leave requests\054 approvals\054 reports\054 calendars\054 exports\054 integrations\054 and configuration\054 but the product also shows how quickly these systems can become process\055heavy when they need to serve employees\054 managers\054 HR\054 and payroll at the same time\056\240)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 617 0 R
     /Pg 614 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

