620 0 obj
  << /ActualText (TIMEOFF\056GURU positions itself as a platform for planning employee time off with requests\054 approvals\054 calendar overview\054 settings\054 locations\054 reports\054 mobile access\054 and integrations with tools like Google Calendar\054 iCal\054 and Outlook\056 It also supports configurable approval processes\054 multiple leave types\054 notifications\054 reports\054 and exports to Excel\056\240)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 621 0 R
     /Pg 614 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

