  << /ActualText (Simplify the request flow so employees can understand what they need to do with minimal effort\056 Improve visibility so users can quickly see balances\054 team availability\054 and request status\056 Reduce visual overload by making calendars and key information easier to scan\056 Support all roles clearly without making the interface feel crowded or difficult to learn\056 Create a calmer experience that feels modern\054 efficient\054 and trustworthy\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
